itions**\\n   - **Empty String:** Return an empty string.\\n   - **String with only non-letter characters:** Reverse the string.\\n   - **String with only letters:** Each letter\'s case is reversed.\\n   - **String with a mix of letters and non-letter characters:** Apply the case reversal to letters and keep non-letters unchanged.\\n\\n4. **Example Implementations**\\n   ```python\\n   def solve(s: str) -> str:\\n       result = []\\n       has_letters = False\\n\\n       for c in s:\\n           if c.isalpha():\\n               if c.islower():\\n                   result.append(c.upper())\\n               else:\\n                   result.append(c.lower())\\n               has_letters = True\\n           else:\\n               result.append(c)\\n\\n       if not has_letters:\\n           result.reverse()\\n\\n       return \'\'.join(result)\\n   ```\\n\\n5. **Testing**\\n   - Test with empty string.\\n   - Test with strings containing only non-letter characters.\\n   - Test with strings containing only letters.\\n   - Test with strings containing a mix of letters and non-letter characters."}'}]
